{
  "label": "bar20",
  "title_zh": "",
  "lines": [
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "label bar20:",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene scoutredux1",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/scoutredux1.webp",
      "alt": "scoutredux1"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I walk into the bar and immediately put my head down as Sara and Sana are locked in a mildly heated argument behind the counter.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I worry for a moment that something like this could potentially drive customers away, but then I remember where I am and decide it's best to not worry at all.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I am a little offended, however, seeing as my presence has not put a stop to whatever debate those two are having.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Granted, I'm probably not even viewed as a customer anymore to them.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Now, I’m just a dude who shows up, has a beer or two, and then proceeds to either lecture or have sex with one of them.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene scoutredux2",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/scoutredux2.webp",
      "alt": "scoutredux2"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Um...h-hi...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You didn’t...hear anything just now did you?",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Hey, Sana.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I didn't hear what it was about, but I could definitely tell it was some sort of argument.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Is everything okay?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Mhm...Everything is fine...I...umm...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I don’t have to work tonight...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Sara’s going to take care of the bar on her own?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I...guess so...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I have...an...umm...important mission to take care of...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": A mission this late?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene scoutredux3",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/scoutredux3.webp",
      "alt": "scoutredux3"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": And, um...it's...a mission for you too, actually...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Wait, what? Why? I just wanted to relax. Why do I have a mission now?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Because that's just...how things worked out...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Well, can you tell me what it is? Or are you just going to stay cryptic about it?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene scoutredux4",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/scoutredux4.webp",
      "alt": "scoutredux4"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I-I’ll tell you! I just need to go get dressed first!",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Please...wait a moment! My clothes are...upstairs...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene scoutredux1",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/scoutredux1.webp",
      "alt": "scoutredux1"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Sana quickly dashes past me and up the stairs to her mother’s apartment.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "It’s quiet enough in here that even the faint tapping of her footsteps manages to bring life to this dying bar.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene scoutredux5",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/scoutredux5.webp",
      "alt": "scoutredux5"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Hiya, stranger~",
      "spk": "Sara",
      "spkColor": "#66B090",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": What the hell was that all about?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Are you talking about our argument? Or about the mission?",
      "spk": "Sara",
      "spkColor": "#66B090",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Both, I guess?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Well, the two of them are connected, so I'll just go ahead explain the whole thing to you.",
      "spk": "Sara",
      "spkColor": "#66B090",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": This ‘mission’ involves checking out another bar in the area that’s been doing...admittedly better than this one.",
      "spk": "Sara",
      "spkColor": "#66B090",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Like, much better.",
      "spk": "Sara",
      "spkColor": "#66B090",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Like it's not even close.",
      "spk": "Sara",
      "spkColor": "#66B090",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": So it’s a...scouting mission?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene scoutredux6",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/scoutredux6.webp",
      "alt": "scoutredux6"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yeah, exactly! You two are going to go check out that bar and see what they’re doing that we’re not.",
      "spk": "Sara",
      "spkColor": "#66B090",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Not sure if you’ve realized this, but my livelihood kinda depends on this place.",
      "spk": "Sara",
      "spkColor": "#66B090",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Unless a certain someone wants to start taking care of me, of course.",
      "spk": "Sara",
      "spkColor": "#66B090",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I'm good, thanks.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene scoutredux7",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/scoutredux7.webp",
      "alt": "scoutredux7"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": At least pretend to think about it, jerk!",
      "spk": "Sara",
      "spkColor": "#66B090",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": That aside, are you sure it’s okay to send Sana to a rival bar?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene scoutredux8",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/scoutredux8.webp",
      "alt": "scoutredux8"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": That’s exactly what we were arguing about! I was supposed to go with you instead!",
      "spk": "Sara",
      "spkColor": "#66B090",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": The two of us going to a bar together would make a lot more sense than you going with my daughter! And it would give us the chance to get to know one another better!",
      "spk": "Sara",
      "spkColor": "#66B090",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": This wasn’t a scouting mission at all, was it? You just wanted to get drunk with me.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene scoutredux6",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/scoutredux6.webp",
      "alt": "scoutredux6"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I mean...that's not all I wanted to do.",
      "spk": "Sara",
      "spkColor": "#66B090",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": That sentence makes the idea of you allowing your daughter to go in your place significantly more disturbing.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene scoutredux8",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/scoutredux8.webp",
      "alt": "scoutredux8"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": It’s not like I wanted to! She just seemed weirdly devoted to not letting me follow you out tonight for some reason!",
      "spk": "Sara",
      "spkColor": "#66B090",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": That’s...interesting.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene scoutredux9",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/scoutredux9.webp",
      "alt": "scoutredux9"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I think she's just jealous.",
      "spk": "Sara",
      "spkColor": "#66B090",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I think it’s less jealousy and more feeling weird about the situation.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Wouldn’t you feel odd if your teacher in [high_school] started dating your mom?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Well, yeah. It would have been weird if we were both dating him.",
      "spk": "Sara",
      "spkColor": "#66B090",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I'm sorry, what?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene scoutredux10",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/scoutredux10.webp",
      "alt": "scoutredux10"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Oh, it's not really a big deal.",
      "spk": "Sara",
      "spkColor": "#66B090",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": It was one of those secret relationship things. No one ever found out about it.",
      "spk": "Sara",
      "spkColor": "#66B090",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Well, at least...not right away...",
      "spk": "Sara",
      "spkColor": "#66B090",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": But it was inevitable that someone eventually would and-",
      "spk": "Sara",
      "spkColor": "#66B090",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene scoutredux5",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/scoutredux5.webp",
      "alt": "scoutredux5"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Wait, why are we even talking about this? That's definitely not something I want to discuss with you yet.",
      "spk": "Sara",
      "spkColor": "#66B090",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": If only we were able to go out for drinks...",
      "spk": "Sara",
      "spkColor": "#66B090",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Sara pauses for a moment and reflects on her past, but the reflection doesn't last long as the same faint tapping of footsteps from earlier makes its way back down the stairs.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’ll see you later, Sara. I’ll be sure to let you know how your rival bar is.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Be good to my daughter. Don't let her drink too much.",
      "spk": "Sara",
      "spkColor": "#66B090",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": It was a joke. You can laugh.",
      "spk": "Sara",
      "spkColor": "#66B090",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene scoutredux2r",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/scoutredux2r.webp",
      "alt": "scoutredux2r"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Um...I’m sorry it took me so long...I couldn’t find my socks...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": It’s fine. I got the details from your mom. Do you know where this place is?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Mhm...It’s not that far from here...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You can just...follow me...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene black",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Misc/black.png",
      "alt": "black"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Sana and I exit the bar.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I turn around to look at Sara as we make our way through the door-",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "But the smile she wore just moments ago has vanished.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "And all I can do is imagine why.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ".........",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "......",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "...",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene sanabartwenty1",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/sanabartwenty1.webp",
      "alt": "sanabartwenty1"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Sana and I take a seat at a table after being led over by a hostess around her mother’s age.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Right off the bat, you can tell this place has a much...warmer atmosphere.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "In fact, I don't even know if I'd call this place a bar considering everyone seems to be eating as well.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I pick up a menu to confirm my suspicions and don't see the word bar anywhere, so I ascertain that Sara's source of intel is just as bad as her management skills and toss away my gameplan for the night.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Sorry, Sara. Your mission was inherently flawed.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Um...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": What’s up?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Nothing’s up...I just...wanted to say...thanks for coming with me...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’ve never gone to another bar before...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You know this isn't a bar, right?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Sana, it's clearly a full service restaurant. There are waiters and everything.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": But...my mom said-",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Your mom says a lot of things and it would probably be best to disregard most of them.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Well...either way...thank you...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene sanabartwenty2",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/sanabartwenty2.webp",
      "alt": "sanabartwenty2"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I guess it’s...pretty easy to see why this place is better...right?",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": It’s...really nice in here...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I bet our...waitress will be really nice too...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "A moment of silence passes by as Sana begins to observe the layout of the place.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene sanabartwenty2r",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/sanabartwenty2r.webp",
      "alt": "sanabartwenty2r"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "But unfortunately, before she's able to take in all of it, someone unexpected shows up.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene sanabartwenty3",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/sanabartwenty3.webp",
      "alt": "sanabartwenty3"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Kaori",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You brought a child?",
      "spk": "Kaori",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene sanabartwenty4",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/sanabartwenty4.webp",
      "alt": "sanabartwenty4"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Ch...Child? No...I’m-",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Sana, I’ll handle this.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Talking to her is beyond your current skill level, I’m afraid.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
