    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/sanabartwenty5.webp",
      "alt": "sanabartwenty5"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Wh-What?...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Explain yourself, Hamburger Man.",
      "spk": "Kaori",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Um...do you...know this girl, Sensei?",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I do. Her name is Kaori, but she also goes by the Mistress of the Queen of the Spider Dark or something.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": The...what?...",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Hamburger Man, I can not provide dizzy drinks to this undersized human.",
      "spk": "Kaori",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": That’s fine because this is a restaurant and not a bar. Not everyone has to drink.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": All of the other human customers order the dizzy drinks. I can not make special exceptions just because this human is not fully grown.",
