      "img": "游戏图片/Events/sanabartwenty6.webp",
      "alt": "sanabartwenty6"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": OKAY NEVER MIND! SORRY I ASKED!",
      "spk": "Sana",
      "spkColor": "#00E77F",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You are a strange creature. Perhaps...a cyclops?...How do you know the Hamburger Man?",
